---
# Formatting for all of the repository's C++: rendering-engine,
# playback-client and the spatial-audio PoC. clang-format searches upward from
# each file, so this one file serves every component.
#
# Deliberately close to Ladybug's own .clang-format: a lot of time is spent
# reading Ladybug source alongside our own, and two different formattings of
# the same language is friction for no benefit.
#
# Apply with `make format-rendering-engine` or `make format-playback-client`
# from the repository root.
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: LLVM

ColumnLimit: 100
IndentWidth: 4
TabWidth: 4
UseTab: Never
ContinuationIndentWidth: 4
AccessModifierOffset: -4
NamespaceIndentation: None

AlignAfterOpenBracket: DontAlign
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Inline
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: Never
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: false
AllowAllParametersOfDeclarationOnNextLine: false
AlwaysBreakTemplateDeclarations: Yes
BreakBeforeBraces: Attach
BreakConstructorInitializers: BeforeColon
BreakInheritanceList: BeforeColon
Cpp11BracedListStyle: true
DerivePointerAlignment: false
PointerAlignment: Left
FixNamespaceComments: true
IndentCaseLabels: false
MaxEmptyLinesToKeep: 1
SpaceBeforeParens: ControlStatements
Standard: c++20

SortIncludes: CaseSensitive
IncludeBlocks: Preserve
...
